    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1745254866\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/94f51de130479f1b128141fec8ab686b.poster.avif?t=1745254866\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/94f51de130479f1b128141fec8ab686b.webm?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/94f51de130479f1b128141fec8ab686b.mp4?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>CursedSword is a Sokoban-style sliding puzzle game where your attacks grow stronger with every move! Bash through monsters, traps, and obstacles to crack snappy puzzles, battle bosses in turn-based showdowns, discover hidden treasures, and unlock game-changing power-ups. Join the hero on a quest to break the curse and bring justice to his hometown!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/d20664ff5d7e09aeeefde1e87e865fa8.poster.avif?t=1745254866\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/d20664ff5d7e09aeeefde1e87e865fa8.webm?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/d20664ff5d7e09aeeefde1e87e865fa8.mp4?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Unlock power-ups on your journey to the Countess Castle. Stuck on a tricky puzzle? These are your secret weapon. Use them strategically to overcome obstacles and break through when you're stuck.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/032043d90dfe6ccdcb8698b573cd7900.poster.avif?t=1745254866\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/032043d90dfe6ccdcb8698b573cd7900.webm?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/032043d90dfe6ccdcb8698b573cd7900.mp4?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Face challenging turn-based boss battles and test your skills against the Countess's fiercest champions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/48a928df360e0bf71a201b83f872db7f.poster.avif?t=1745254866\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/48a928df360e0bf71a201b83f872db7f.webm?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/48a928df360e0bf71a201b83f872db7f.mp4?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Embark on a journey through a spooky island ruled by danger and evil monsters.<br></li><li>Hundreds of deadly puzzles.<br></li><li>Retro inspired 2D top-down pixel graphics.<br></li><li>A snappy grid-based movement that lets you plan every move!<br></li><li>Eight mysterious areas of the Haunted Island full of monsters and traps!<br></li><li>Challenging turn-based boss fights protecting the way to the Countess's Castle.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/94f51de130479f1b128141fec8ab686b.poster.avif?t=1745254866\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/94f51de130479f1b128141fec8ab686b.webm?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/94f51de130479f1b128141fec8ab686b.mp4?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>CursedSword is a Sokoban-style sliding puzzle game where your attacks grow stronger with every move! Bash through monsters, traps, and obstacles to crack snappy puzzles, battle bosses in turn-based showdowns, discover hidden treasures, and unlock game-changing power-ups. Join the hero on a quest to break the curse and bring justice to his hometown!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/d20664ff5d7e09aeeefde1e87e865fa8.poster.avif?t=1745254866\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/d20664ff5d7e09aeeefde1e87e865fa8.webm?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/d20664ff5d7e09aeeefde1e87e865fa8.mp4?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Unlock power-ups on your journey to the Countess Castle. Stuck on a tricky puzzle? These are your secret weapon. Use them strategically to overcome obstacles and break through when you're stuck.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/032043d90dfe6ccdcb8698b573cd7900.poster.avif?t=1745254866\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/032043d90dfe6ccdcb8698b573cd7900.webm?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/032043d90dfe6ccdcb8698b573cd7900.mp4?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Face challenging turn-based boss battles and test your skills against the Countess's fiercest champions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/48a928df360e0bf71a201b83f872db7f.poster.avif?t=1745254866\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/48a928df360e0bf71a201b83f872db7f.webm?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/48a928df360e0bf71a201b83f872db7f.mp4?t=1745254866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Embark on a journey through a spooky island ruled by danger and evil monsters.<br></li><li>Hundreds of deadly puzzles.<br></li><li>Retro inspired 2D top-down pixel graphics.<br></li><li>A snappy grid-based movement that lets you plan every move!<br></li><li>Eight mysterious areas of the Haunted Island full of monsters and traps!<br></li><li>Challenging turn-based boss fights protecting the way to the Countess's Castle.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Slide into mystery in this Sokoban-style puzzle game! Your attack grows with each move as you bash into monsters, traps, and obstacles to solve snappy puzzles. Face bosses in turn-based battles, find treasures, and unlock power-ups in your quest to break the curse and avenge your hometown.",
